    {
      "source": "The <code>cassandra:repositories</code> namespace element causes the base packages to be scanned for interfaces that extend <code>CrudRepository</code> and create Spring beans for each one found.\nBy default, the repositories are wired with a <code>CassandraTemplate</code> Spring bean called <code>cassandraTemplate</code>, so you only need to configure\n<code>cassandra-template-ref</code> explicitly if you deviate from this convention.",
      "translation": "`cassandra:repositories` 命名空间元素会扫描基础包以查找继承自 `CrudRepository` 的接口，并为每个找到的接口创建 Spring Bean。  \n默认情况下，这些仓库会与名为 `cassandraTemplate` 的 `CassandraTemplate` Spring Bean 进行注入，因此除非您偏离此约定，否则无需显式配置 `cassandra-template-ref`。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Note that the entity has a property named <code>id</code> of type <code>String</code>.\nThe default conversion mechanism used in <code>MappingCassandraConverter</code> (which backs the repository support) regards properties named <code>id</code> as being the row ID.",
      "translation": "请注意，该实体具有一个名为<code>id</code>且类型为<code>String</code>的属性。\n<code>MappingCassandraConverter</code>（其支持仓储功能）中使用的默认转换机制将名为<code>id</code>的属性视为行 ID。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Because our domain repository extends <code>CrudRepository</code> respective <code>ReactiveCrudRepository</code>, it provides you with basic CRUD operations.\nWorking with the repository instance is a matter of injecting the repository as a dependency into a client, as the following example does by autowiring <code>PersonRepository</code>:",
      "translation": "由于我们的领域仓库扩展了 `<code>CrudRepository`》（分别对应 `<code>ReactiveCrudRepository`），因此它提供了基本的 CRUD 操作。\n与仓库实例交互只需将其作为依赖注入到客户端中，如下面的示例通过自动装配 `<code>PersonRepository`》所示：",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Cassandra repositories support paging and sorting for paginated and sorted access to the entities.\nCassandra paging requires a paging state to forward-only navigate through pages.\nA <code>Slice</code> keeps track of the current paging state and allows for creation of a <code>Pageable</code> to request the next page.\nThe following example shows how to set up paging access to <code>Person</code> entities:",
      "translation": "Cassandra 存储库支持分页和排序，以便对实体进行分页和排序访问。  \nCassandra 的分页需要一个分页状态，以仅向前导航通过各个页面。  \n一个 `<code>Slice</code>` 会跟踪当前的分页状态，并允许创建 `<code>Pageable</code>` 来请求下一页。  \n以下示例展示了如何设置对 `<code>Person</code>` 实体的分页访问：",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "If you want to use Java configuration, use the <code>@EnableCassandraRepositories</code> respective <code>@EnableReactiveCassandraRepositories</code> annotation.\nThe annotation carries the same attributes as the namespace element.\nIf no base package is configured, the infrastructure scans the package of the annotated configuration class.\nThe following example show how to the different configuration approaches:",
      "translation": "如果您想使用 Java 配置，请使用相应的 `<code>@EnableCassandraRepositories</code>` 或 `<code>@EnableReactiveCassandraRepositories</code>` 注解。  \n该注解携带与命名空间元素相同的属性。  \n如果未配置基础包，则基础设施将扫描带注解的配置类所在的包。  \n以下示例展示了不同的配置方法：",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "The following example shows a repository definition to persist <code>Person</code> entities:",
      "translation": "下面的示例展示了用于持久化 `<code>Person</code>` 实体的仓库定义：",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "The preceding example creates an application context with Spring’s unit test support, which performs annotation-based dependency injection into the test class.\nInside the test cases (the test methods), we use the repository to query the data store.\nWe invoke the repository query method that requests all <code>Person</code> instances.",
      "translation": "前面的示例使用 Spring 的单元测试支持创建了一个应用上下文，该上下文会向测试类执行基于注解的依赖注入。  \n在测试用例（即测试方法）中，我们使用该仓库查询数据存储。  \n我们调用请求所有 `<code>Person</code>` 实例的仓库查询方法。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "To access domain entities stored in Apache Cassandra, you can use Spring Data’s sophisticated repository support, which significantly eases implementing DAOs.\nTo do so, create an interface for your repository, as the following example shows:",
      "translation": "要访问存储在 Apache Cassandra 中的领域实体，您可以使用 Spring Data 功能强大的仓库支持，这极大地简化了 DAO 的实现。\n为此，请按照以下示例为仓库创建一个接口：",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Right now, the interface in the preceding example serves only typing purposes, but we add additional methods to it later.",
      "translation": "目前，前面示例中的界面仅用于输入文本，但我们会稍后为其添加更多方法。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Next, in your Spring configuration, add the following (if you use Java for configuration):",
      "translation": "接下来，在您的 Spring 配置中添加以下内容（如果您使用 Java 进行配置）：",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Imperative Java Configuration",
      "translation": "强制性 Java 配置",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Reactive Java Configuration",
      "translation": "响应式 Java 配置",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Spring Data’s repository abstraction is a dynamic API that is mostly defined by you and your requirements as you declare query methods.\nReactive Cassandra repositories can be implemented by using either RxJava or Project Reactor wrapper types by extending from one of the library-specific repository interfaces:",
      "translation": "Spring Data 的仓库抽象是一个动态 API，主要通过您声明查询方法来定义，而具体由您和您的需求决定。  \n可以使用 RxJava 或 Project Reactor 包装类型来实现响应式 Cassandra 仓库，只需从库特定的仓库接口之一进行扩展：",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Spring Data converts reactive wrapper types behind the scenes so that you can stick to your favorite composition library.",
      "translation": "Spring Data 在幕后将响应式包装类型进行转换，使您可以继续使用自己偏好的组合库。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
